DEFECT &#125;o--o&#123; REQUIREMENT : &quot;affects&quot; DEFECT &#125;o--o&#123; TEST_CASE : &quot;found by&quot; DEFECT &#125;o--o&#123; TEST_EXECUTION : &quot;discovered in&quot;
5. 项目与分析数据模型erDiagram PROJECT &#123; string id PK string name string description string[] members string[] roles date start_date date end_date string status string progress &#125;
PROJECT_MILESTONE &#123; string id PK string project_id FK string name string description date due_date string status string[] deliverables &#125;
